      "A $30°$, $60°$ or $45°$ angle? Gold or silver?",
      "Equal sides? Mark them, look for isosceles.",
      "Area: which side, and ITS altitude?",
      "Do the three sides really make a triangle?"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "⚠ Common traps",
   "class": "traps",
   "col": "R",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "traps",
     "items": [
      "Pythagoras in a triangle with no right angle.",
      "Adding when you should subtract (finding a leg).",
      "Mixing the long leg $a\\sqrt3$ with the hypotenuse $2a$.",
      "The altitude of an obtuse triangle lands outside it.",
      "A side as long as the sum of the other two: no triangle."
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
