       "Two angles known",
       "Angle sum $180°$, or the exterior angle."
      ],
      [
       "Two sides, the third unknown",
       "Between the difference and the sum."
      ],
      [
       "A right triangle with two sides",
       "Look for a triple first, then Pythagoras."
      ],
      [
       "A $30°$, $60°$ or $45°$ angle",
